      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.00001,
        "t": 214.47407999999996,
        "r": 493.0100100000004,
        "b": 202.88408000000004
      },
      "content": "An MFP printer is shown in this section. However, the procedure is correct for all printer models."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0214",
      "reading_order": 247,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 112.99996,
        "t": 193.47407999999996,
        "r": 534.9099600000004,
        "b": 169.88408000000004
      },
      "content": "Align the toner cartridge with the tracks inside the printer, and then install the toner cartridge until it is firmly seated."
    },
